{"id":122,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"The behavior of this clown-like Pokémon reminds one of pantomime. It creates invisible walls using a force emitted from its fingertips."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It’s known for its top-notch pantomime skills. It protects itself from all sorts of attacks by emitting auras from its fingers to create walls."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"The broadness of its hands may be no coincidence—many scientists believe its palms became enlarged specifically for pantomiming."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!"],"text":"Always practicing its pantomime act. It makes enemies believe something exists that really doesn’t."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It creates invisible walls with its pantomiming. If you don’t act impressed, it will attack you with a double slap!"},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Its pantomime skills are wonderful. You may become enraptured while watching it, but next thing you know, Mr. Mime has made a real wall."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby"],"text":"Mr. Mime is a master of pantomime. Its gestures and motions convince watchers that something unseeable actually exists. Once the watchers are convinced, the unseeable thing exists as if it were real."},{"games":["Y","FireRed"],"text":"It is adept at conning people. It is said to be able to create walls out of thin air by miming."},{"games":["X","Pearl"],"text":"Emanations from its fingertips solidify the air into invisible walls that repel even harsh attacks."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It shapes an invisible wall in midair by minutely vibrating its fingertips to stop molecules in the air."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Its fingertips emit a peculiar force field that hardens air to create an actual wall."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"A skilled mime from birth, it gains the ability to create invisible objects as it matures."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"It is a pantomime expert that can create invisible but solid walls using miming gestures."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"If interrupted while it is miming, it will suddenly DOUBLESLAP the offender with its broad hands."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Soundproof","hidden":false,"description":"Soundproofing gives the Pokémon full immunity to all sound-based moves."},{"name":"Filter","hidden":false,"description":"Reduces the power of supereffective attacks that hit the Pokémon."},{"name":"Technician","hidden":true,"description":"Powers up weak moves so the Pokémon can deal more damage with them."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"urban","color":"Pink","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":439,"name":"Mime Jr.","condition":null,"children":[{"id":122,"name":"Mr. Mime","condition":"Level up, knowing Mimic or Level up, knowing Mimic, in Galar","children":[{"id":866,"name":"Mr. Rime","condition":"Lv. 42","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,1],[1,226],[1,227],[1,383],[1,384],[1,385],[1,469],[1,501],[12,93],[16,272],[20,182],[24,278],[28,60],[32,102],[36,113],[36,115],[36,219],[40,389],[44,605],[48,94],[52,298]],"machine":[502,213,226,34,280,347,204,605,409,227,203,412,263,7,374,411,492,248,416,447,385,270,63,8,196,334,113,478,345,25,5,118,581,595,417,371,384,182,94,678,473,240,115,156,496,219,247,285,214,173,76,500,164,241,269,168,87,9,86,85,271,433,253,472,428],"egg":[109,252,95,471,321],"tutor":[797]},"cards":[{"id":"sv3pt5-179","name":"Mr. Mime","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"179","artist":"OKACHEKE","img":"sv3pt5/179"},{"id":"sv9-58","name":"Mr. Mime","set":"Journey Together","date":"2025-03-28","rarity":"Common","number":"58","artist":null,"img":"sv9/58"},{"id":"sv5-63","name":"Mr. Mime","set":"Temporal Forces","date":"2024-03-22","rarity":"Common","number":"63","artist":"Nelnal","img":"sv5/63"},{"id":"sv3pt5-122","name":"Mr. Mime","set":"151","